OL,3,GNEWSASix more arrests in murder probe
OL,4,Aover stab death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix more people have been arrested as
OL,7,Fpart of a murder probe launched after a
OL,8,Fman was stabbed to death.
OL,10,FA 27-year-old man died in Moss Bank in
OL,11,FCrumpsall, Manchester, shortly after
OL,12,F01:30 GMT on Saturday, following an
OL,13,Fattack by "a number of males".
OL,15,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said it
OL,16,Fhad arrested two men on suspicion of
OL,17,Fmurder, and four other people on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender.
OL,20,FAnother man arrested after the incident
OL,21,Fon suspicion of murder, remains in
OL,22,Fcustody, the force said.
